# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/exact-end window (exact resume P0 on the production stack; scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/exact-end and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN, ONE TAG AT A TIME (wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job).
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from the branch by its author. ORDER.txt has the
# order, the stop rules, the minutes and the read rules.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-xe-1 is a PLACEHOLDER for the tag B0 builds from the pushed branch head WITH the K64j-OQ graft (sed -i 's/tp4-xe-1/<tag>/' *.env). A commit of a file
# the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. This window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# C2_MODEL_REPO / C2_MODEL_REVISION (qwen_c2_checkpoint.py): a job that carries them serves the Swift checkpoint (what production serves) from its own converted-weight directory, in the prefix gate's
# containers too (c2_prefix_gate.py reads every arm's log for the checkpoint lines and fails the arm without them); the keys are the same in every serving job of this pack, so each pair differs by the profile alone.
# XX (EXACTNESS of exact resume P0 on the production stack, STOP): c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-xe-audit, the ship-4 audited twin with the undrop,
# the window carry and the carry's audit, on Swift. the prefix gate's exact-resume plan (prefix_replay.scenario_exact_resume): three conversations of real repository text
# whose first prompts are about 9k, 33k and 120k tokens, then six returning tool turns each of 150, 400, 900, 1,700, 2,600 and 300 new tokens, so the tail a turn
# re-prefills crosses both sides of 2,048 - (P mod 2,048): the window carry engaged and not engaged. Every turn is a cold run under a fresh salt and the hit under the
# conversation's salt, compared token for token (strict), the oracle's Q strict (prefix_judge.Oracle with the undrop and the carry: a carried resume above P - 2048 wherever
# the new content stays under 2048 - (P mod 2048)). READ: the plan PASS: every cold/hit pair IDENTICAL; every continuation's Q the oracle's (none above it; under it only
# with an eviction on record); exact_resume_findings: the engaged line with undrop=1 carry=1, at least one carried admission, every window carry audit line exact=True (the
# carried rows read back as stored) and every cold/hit pair's two window digests EQUAL (the hit's spliced drafter window is the cold twin's byte for byte); the carry's
# lines: "[PINDIAG] prefix: window carry engaged undrop=1 carry=1" once, "... carried req= Q= P= rows=" for every carried admission and "... stored req= pos= rows= bytes=
# ms=" for every export, and, beside the tile-aligned window of this profile, "[PINDIAG] tap window aligned engaged ... parts=2" on a carried turn (the carried rows are the
# first aligned part: prefix_window_carry.Carried.align) with no "fell back" line; every other audit line of the candidate exact=True; no program growth after the warm;
# CHECKPOINT READ (the prefix gate checks every arm's container log, the smoke step passes c2_smoke_check.py --expect-checkpoint): the log holds "[QWEN-C2] checkpoint
# ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b@b4c84d42903a8646b25857eb2827288d92ed85a4 key=... weight_cache=.../weights-ckpt/<key> base_cache=... (the base cache is not read or written)"
# once, a "weight cache ...: found" line (the cache the Swift window built; this pack never builds it) and the worker's "[QWEN-C2] checkpoint bound ..." line; the arm's
# result line says "checkpoint ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b@b4c84d42903a: read". ANY difference is NO-GO. RUN WITH THE CI PAUSED. Duration (estimate): about 2 hours (the
# ~120k conversation's cold twins dominate: seven ~40 s cold prefills, and an audited 8x262k boot).
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-xe-1
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=exact-resume
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-ship-prefix-levern-w2-er-fx-s4-xe-audit
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=none
C2_MODEL_REPO=ukisai/Swift-1.5-Qwen3.8-27b
C2_MODEL_REVISION=b4c84d42903a8646b25857eb2827288d92ed85a4
C2_BOX_MINUTES=170
